{
  "openapi": "3.1.0",
  "info": {
    "title": "Varda Free Flyers club app API",
    "version": "1",
    "description": "Read (and, with a write key, change) one member's view of the Varda Free Flyers club app.\n\n## Getting a key\nA member signs in at vardafreeflyers.com, opens **Profile → Personal access keys**, names a key and presses **Create key**. The key (`vff_…`) is shown **once**; only its hash is stored. Revoking it on the same card stops it on the next request.\n\nA key is **read-only** unless the member ticked **\"Also let this key book, change and cancel my bookings, and file and correct my flights\"** when making it. That choice can't be changed later; make a new key instead.\n\n## Using it\nSend it on every request: `Authorization: Bearer vff_…`. A browser session is NOT accepted on these endpoints, and a missing, wrong or revoked key gets `401`.\n\n## What a key can see\nExactly what its member sees in the app, nothing more: the club's airplanes (status, squawks, maintenance), the next 30 days of bookings, **the member's own** flight log and currency, and **the member's own** unpaid balance. Never another member's statement, paperwork or log. A key acts as a plain member even on an admin's account.\n\n**A key IS its member.** Anyone holding it sees that member's flying and balance and, with a write key, can book and file as them. Give each person their own account and key rather than sharing one, and prefer read-only keys for anything that only reads.\n\n## Club data keys\nAn **admin** can also tick **\"Also let this key read club data\"** when making a key. That key additionally reads `GET /api/agent/club`: each pilot's certificate and ratings, declared total time and landings over the last 90 days, who last flew each airplane, plus the schedule. No flight-by-flight log. Over MCP it also gets `get_pilots` and `get_last_flown`. It covers every member, so keep it to the officer who needs it, and revoke it when they're done.\n\n## Two ways in\n- **`GET /api/agent`**: everything in one JSON document (and `GET /api/agent/club` for a club-data key). The simplest way to pull data.\n- **`POST /api/mcp`**: the same data as Model Context Protocol tools, for AI assistants (Claude, etc.). Write keys also get the writing tools there.\n\nTimes are ISO-8601 instants (UTC); show them in `clubTimeZone`. Money is in US dollars."
  },
  "servers": [
    {
      "url": "https://www.vardafreeflyers.com",
      "description": "Production"
    }
  ],
  "security": [
    {
      "accessKey": []
    }
  ],
  "tags": [
    {
      "name": "Read",
      "description": "One-call JSON snapshot."
    },
    {
      "name": "Club data",
      "description": "Admin-made club-data keys only."
    },
    {
      "name": "MCP",
      "description": "For AI assistants."
    }
  ],
  "paths": {
    "/api/agent": {
      "get": {
        "tags": [
          "Read"
        ],
        "operationId": "getSnapshot",
        "summary": "Everything the key's member can see, in one call",
        "description": "Read-only: nothing is synced or billed by reading; the only write is the key's own \"last used\" time. Not cached (`Cache-Control: no-store`).\n\n```sh\ncurl -H \"Authorization: Bearer $VFF_KEY\" https://www.vardafreeflyers.com/api/agent\n```",
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "The snapshot.",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Snapshot"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "401": {
            "description": "No key, a wrong key or a revoked key.",
            "headers": {
              "WWW-Authenticate": {
                "schema": {
                  "type": "string",
                  "example": "Bearer realm=\"vff\""
                }
              }
            },
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Error"
                }
              }
            }
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "/api/agent/club": {
      "get": {
        "tags": [
          "Club data"
        ],
        "operationId": "getClubData",
        "summary": "Every pilot's ratings, total time and 90-day landings, who flew each airplane last, and the schedule (club-data keys only)",
        "description": "Each pilot's certificate, declared total time and landings in the last 90 days, who last flew each airplane, and every booking for the next 30 days, in one call. No flight-by-flight log. Needs a key an admin made with **club data** ticked; it stops working if that member stops being an admin. Read-only, not cached.\n\n```sh\ncurl -H \"Authorization: Bearer $VFF_KEY\" https://www.vardafreeflyers.com/api/agent/club\n```",
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "The club's data.",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ClubSnapshot"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "401": {
            "description": "No key, a wrong key or a revoked key.",
            "headers": {
              "WWW-Authenticate": {
                "schema": {
                  "type": "string",
                  "example": "Bearer realm=\"vff\""
                }
              }
            },
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Error"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "403": {
            "description": "A valid key that wasn't made for club data (or whose member is no longer an admin).",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Error"
                }
              }
            }
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "/api/mcp": {
      "post": {
        "tags": [
          "MCP"
        ],
        "operationId": "mcp",
        "summary": "MCP server (JSON-RPC 2.0)",
        "description": "A stateless [Model Context Protocol](https://modelcontextprotocol.io) server over Streamable HTTP: one JSON-RPC message (or a batch) per POST, a plain JSON reply, tools only. Supported protocol versions: 2025-11-25, 2025-06-18, 2025-03-26, 2024-11-05.\n\n**Reading tools (every key):** `get_club_snapshot` (all of it), `get_aircraft_status`, `get_bookings`, `get_my_flying`, `get_my_balance`. They return the same sections as `GET /api/agent`.\n\n**Club tools (club-data keys only):** `get_pilots` (every pilot's certificate, total time and landings in the last 90 days) and `get_last_flown` (who last flew each airplane). They return the `pilots` and `lastFlown` sections of `GET /api/agent/club`.\n\n**Writing tools (write keys only):** `book_airplane`, `update_booking`, `cancel_booking`, `file_flight`, `update_flight`. Each runs the app's own rules: the booking rules and conflict check, Google Calendar, meter validation and billing. Call `tools/list` for each tool's exact JSON Schema. Times are club local time (`\"2026-11-14T09:00\"`) or an ISO instant with an offset. A key can only change its own member's bookings and flights.\n\nA refusal (a clash, a bad reading) comes back as a tool result with `isError: true` and a sentence saying why. A request containing only notifications gets `202` with no body.\n\nFor the Claude Agent SDK:\n```ts\nmcpServers: {\n  vff: {\n    type: \"http\",\n    url: \"https://www.vardafreeflyers.com/api/mcp\",\n    headers: { Authorization: `Bearer ${process.env.VFF_ACCESS_KEY}` },\n  },\n}\n```",
        "requestBody": {
          "required": true,
          "content": {
            "application/json": {
              "schema": {
                "oneOf": [
                  {
                    "$ref": "#/components/schemas/JsonRpcRequest"
                  },
                  {
                    "type": "array",
                    "items": {
                      "$ref": "#/components/schemas/JsonRpcRequest"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              "examples": {
                "list": {
                  "summary": "List the tools this key may use",
                  "value": {
                    "jsonrpc": "2.0",
                    "id": 1,
                    "method": "tools/list"
                  }
                },
                "read": {
                  "summary": "Read the airplanes' status",
                  "value": {
                    "jsonrpc": "2.0",
                    "id": 2,
                    "method": "tools/call",
                    "params": {
                      "name": "get_aircraft_status",
                      "arguments": {}
                    }
                  }
                },
                "book": {
                  "summary": "Book (write keys only)",
                  "value": {
                    "jsonrpc": "2.0",
                    "id": 3,
                    "method": "tools/call",
                    "params": {
                      "name": "book_airplane",
                      "arguments": {
                        "startsAt": "2026-11-21T09:00",
                        "endsAt": "2026-11-21T11:00",
                        "purpose": "LOCAL"
                      }
                    }
                  }
                },
                "move": {
                  "summary": "Move a booking's end (write keys only)",
                  "value": {
                    "jsonrpc": "2.0",
                    "id": 4,
                    "method": "tools/call",
                    "params": {
                      "name": "update_booking",
                      "arguments": {
                        "bookingId": "<id from get_bookings>",
                        "endsAt": "2026-11-21T12:00"
                      }
                    }
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          }
        },
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "The JSON-RPC reply (or an array of them, for a batch).",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "oneOf": [
                    {
                      "$ref": "#/components/schemas/JsonRpcResponse"
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "array",
                      "items": {
                        "$ref": "#/components/schemas/JsonRpcResponse"
                      }
                    }
                  ]
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "202": {
            "description": "Only notifications were sent; nothing to reply."
          },
          "400": {
            "description": "The body isn't JSON (a JSON-RPC parse error)."
          },
          "401": {
            "description": "No key, a wrong key or a revoked key.",
            "headers": {
              "WWW-Authenticate": {
                "schema": {
                  "type": "string",
                  "example": "Bearer realm=\"vff\""
                }
              }
            },
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Error"
                }
              }
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "get": {
        "tags": [
          "MCP"
        ],
        "operationId": "mcpStream",
        "summary": "Not supported (this server never streams)",
        "responses": {
          "405": {
            "description": "POST instead."
          }
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "components": {
    "securitySchemes": {
      "accessKey": {
        "type": "http",
        "scheme": "bearer",
        "bearerFormat": "vff_…",
        "description": "A personal access key from Profile → Personal access keys."
      }
    },
    "schemas": {
      "Error": {
        "type": "object",
        "required": [
          "error"
        ],
        "properties": {
          "error": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "A sentence saying what's wrong, meant to be shown as-is."
          }
        }
      },
      "Member": {
        "type": "object",
        "required": [
          "name",
          "email",
          "offices",
          "isAdmin"
        ],
        "properties": {
          "name": {
            "type": "string"
          },
          "email": {
            "type": "string"
          },
          "offices": {
            "type": "array",
            "items": {
              "type": "string"
            },
            "description": "Club offices the key holder holds, e.g. FINANCE_OFFICER."
          },
          "isAdmin": {
            "type": "boolean"
          }
        },
        "description": "Who the key belongs to. Everything else in the snapshot is what THIS member can see."
      },
      "Squawk": {
        "type": "object",
        "required": [
          "title",
          "status",
          "reportedOn"
        ],
        "properties": {
          "title": {
            "type": "string"
          },
          "status": {
            "type": "string",
            "enum": [
              "New",
              "Reviewed — okay to fly",
              "Reviewed — in work",
              "Reviewed — aircraft grounded",
              "Closed"
            ]
          },
          "reportedOn": {
            "type": "string",
            "format": "date-time"
          }
        }
      },
      "MaintenanceItem": {
        "type": "object",
        "required": [
          "item",
          "state",
          "remaining",
          "dueOn",
          "dueAtTach",
          "requiredByRegulation",
          "groundsTheAirplane"
        ],
        "properties": {
          "item": {
            "type": "string",
            "example": "Engine oil change"
          },
          "state": {
            "type": "string",
            "enum": [
              "Overdue",
              "Due soon",
              "In limits",
              "Not tracked"
            ]
          },
          "remaining": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "Human-readable, e.g. \"1.4 hrs\" or \"261 days\"."
          },
          "dueOn": {
            "type": [
              "string",
              "null"
            ],
            "format": "date-time"
          },
          "dueAtTach": {
            "type": [
              "number",
              "null"
            ]
          },
          "requiredByRegulation": {
            "type": "boolean"
          },
          "groundsTheAirplane": {
            "type": "boolean"
          }
        }
      },
      "Aircraft": {
        "type": "object",
        "required": [
          "tailNumber",
          "model",
          "homeBase",
          "hourlyRateDollars",
          "tach",
          "hobbs",
          "status",
          "groundedBecause",
          "openSquawks",
          "maintenance"
        ],
        "properties": {
          "tailNumber": {
            "type": "string",
            "example": "N8318B"
          },
          "model": {
            "type": "string"
          },
          "homeBase": {
            "type": [
              "string",
              "null"
            ]
          },
          "hourlyRateDollars": {
            "type": [
              "number",
              "null"
            ],
            "description": "Wet rate, US dollars per tach hour."
          },
          "tach": {
            "type": [
              "number",
              "null"
            ]
          },
          "hobbs": {
            "type": [
              "number",
              "null"
            ]
          },
          "status": {
            "type": "string",
            "enum": [
              "AIRWORTHY",
              "IN_MAINTENANCE",
              "GROUNDED"
            ],
            "description": "GROUNDED = a grounding squawk or a legally required inspection past due. IN_MAINTENANCE = a squawk being worked, which is NOT a grounding."
          },
          "groundedBecause": {
            "type": "array",
            "items": {
              "type": "string"
            }
          },
          "openSquawks": {
            "type": "array",
            "items": {
              "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Squawk"
            }
          },
          "maintenance": {
            "type": "array",
            "items": {
              "$ref": "#/components/schemas/MaintenanceItem"
            },
            "description": "Most urgent first."
          }
        }
      },
      "Booking": {
        "type": "object",
        "required": [
          "id",
          "startsAt",
          "endsAt",
          "allDay",
          "tailNumber",
          "bookedBy",
          "purpose",
          "instructor",
          "notes",
          "yours",
          "youAreTheInstructor"
        ],
        "properties": {
          "id": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "Pass to update_booking / cancel_booking (write keys only)."
          },
          "startsAt": {
            "type": "string",
            "format": "date-time"
          },
          "endsAt": {
            "type": "string",
            "format": "date-time"
          },
          "allDay": {
            "type": "boolean"
          },
          "tailNumber": {
            "type": "string"
          },
          "bookedBy": {
            "type": [
              "string",
              "null"
            ]
          },
          "purpose": {
            "type": "string",
            "enum": [
              "Local flight",
              "Cross-country",
              "Training (with CFI)",
              "Training (Solo)",
              "Checkride",
              "Maintenance"
            ]
          },
          "instructor": {
            "type": [
              "string",
              "null"
            ]
          },
          "notes": {
            "type": [
              "string",
              "null"
            ]
          },
          "yours": {
            "type": "boolean",
            "description": "True for the key holder's own booking."
          },
          "youAreTheInstructor": {
            "type": "boolean"
          }
        }
      },
      "Bookings": {
        "type": "object",
        "required": [
          "window",
          "bookings"
        ],
        "properties": {
          "window": {
            "type": "object",
            "required": [
              "from",
              "to"
            ],
            "properties": {
              "from": {
                "type": "string",
                "format": "date-time"
              },
              "to": {
                "type": "string",
                "format": "date-time"
              }
            }
          },
          "bookings": {
            "type": "array",
            "items": {
              "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Booking"
            }
          }
        },
        "description": "Every booking on the club's airplanes for the next 30 days (the calendar every member can read)."
      },
      "Flight": {
        "type": "object",
        "required": [
          "id",
          "flownOn",
          "tailNumber",
          "tachHours",
          "tachStart",
          "tachEnd",
          "hobbsStart",
          "hobbsEnd",
          "landings",
          "nightLandings",
          "type",
          "route",
          "instructor",
          "instructorSigned",
          "inProgress",
          "notes",
          "logEntry"
        ],
        "properties": {
          "id": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "Pass to update_flight (write keys only)."
          },
          "flownOn": {
            "type": "string",
            "format": "date-time"
          },
          "tailNumber": {
            "type": "string"
          },
          "tachHours": {
            "type": [
              "number",
              "null"
            ],
            "description": "Null when either tach reading is missing."
          },
          "tachStart": {
            "type": [
              "number",
              "null"
            ]
          },
          "tachEnd": {
            "type": [
              "number",
              "null"
            ]
          },
          "hobbsStart": {
            "type": [
              "number",
              "null"
            ]
          },
          "hobbsEnd": {
            "type": [
              "number",
              "null"
            ]
          },
          "landings": {
            "type": "integer"
          },
          "nightLandings": {
            "type": "integer"
          },
          "type": {
            "type": [
              "string",
              "null"
            ],
            "enum": [
              "Local flight",
              "Cross-country",
              "Training (with CFI)",
              "Training (Solo)",
              "Checkride",
              "Maintenance",
              null
            ]
          },
          "route": {
            "type": [
              "string",
              "null"
            ]
          },
          "instructor": {
            "type": [
              "string",
              "null"
            ]
          },
          "instructorSigned": {
            "type": "boolean"
          },
          "inProgress": {
            "type": "boolean",
            "description": "True while the airplane is still out (the entry isn't filed yet)."
          },
          "notes": {
            "type": [
              "string",
              "null"
            ]
          },
          "logEntry": {
            "type": [
              "string",
              "null"
            ],
            "description": "The pilot's own write-up, Markdown (bold, italic, lists)."
          }
        }
      },
      "LandingCurrency": {
        "type": "object",
        "required": [
          "windowDays",
          "dayLandings",
          "nightLandings",
          "maySoloByDay",
          "maySoloAtNight",
          "why",
          "note"
        ],
        "properties": {
          "windowDays": {
            "type": "integer"
          },
          "dayLandings": {
            "type": "integer"
          },
          "nightLandings": {
            "type": "integer"
          },
          "maySoloByDay": {
            "type": "boolean"
          },
          "maySoloAtNight": {
            "type": "boolean"
          },
          "why": {
            "type": "array",
            "items": {
              "type": "string"
            }
          },
          "note": {
            "type": "string"
          }
        }
      },
      "Flying": {
        "type": "object",
        "required": [
          "declaredTotalTimeHours",
          "hoursInClubLogLast12Months",
          "hoursInClubLogThisYear",
          "operatingRulesColumn",
          "landingCurrency",
          "recentFlights"
        ],
        "properties": {
          "declaredTotalTimeHours": {
            "type": [
              "number",
              "null"
            ]
          },
          "hoursInClubLogLast12Months": {
            "type": "number"
          },
          "hoursInClubLogThisYear": {
            "type": "number"
          },
          "operatingRulesColumn": {
            "type": "string",
            "enum": [
              "Experienced member (solo or PIC)",
              "Building time (solo or PIC)",
              "With an approved flight instructor"
            ]
          },
          "landingCurrency": {
            "$ref": "#/components/schemas/LandingCurrency"
          },
          "recentFlights": {
            "type": "array",
            "items": {
              "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Flight"
            },
            "description": "The key holder's own latest 15 log entries, newest first."
          }
        },
        "description": "The key holder's OWN flying. Never anyone else's log."
      },
      "MoneyLine": {
        "type": "object",
        "required": [
          "date",
          "kind",
          "description",
          "amountDollars"
        ],
        "properties": {
          "date": {
            "type": "string",
            "format": "date-time"
          },
          "kind": {
            "type": "string",
            "enum": [
              "Dues",
              "Flight time",
              "Fuel credit",
              "Charge",
              "Landing fee",
              "Monthly payback",
              "Reimbursement"
            ]
          },
          "description": {
            "type": "string"
          },
          "amountDollars": {
            "type": "number",
            "description": "Positive = owed to the club, negative = a credit."
          }
        }
      },
      "Money": {
        "type": [
          "object",
          "null"
        ],
        "required": [
          "outstandingDollars",
          "meaning",
          "unpaidLines"
        ],
        "properties": {
          "outstandingDollars": {
            "type": "number",
            "description": "Positive = the member owes the club; negative = the club owes the member."
          },
          "meaning": {
            "type": "string"
          },
          "unpaidLines": {
            "type": "array",
            "items": {
              "$ref": "#/components/schemas/MoneyLine"
            }
          }
        },
        "description": "The key holder's OWN unpaid statement lines, as already on the books. Null for an instructor-only account."
      },
      "Snapshot": {
        "type": "object",
        "required": [
          "generatedAt",
          "clubTimeZone",
          "member",
          "aircraft",
          "bookings",
          "flying",
          "money"
        ],
        "properties": {
          "generatedAt": {
            "type": "string",
            "format": "date-time"
          },
          "clubTimeZone": {
            "type": "string",
            "example": "America/Los_Angeles"
          },
          "member": {
            "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Member"
          },
          "aircraft": {
            "type": "array",
            "items": {
              "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Aircraft"
            }
          },
          "bookings": {
            "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Bookings"
          },
          "flying": {
            "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Flying"
          },
          "money": {
            "oneOf": [
              {
                "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Money"
              },
              {
                "type": "null"
              }
            ]
          }
        }
      },
      "JsonRpcRequest": {
        "type": "object",
        "required": [
          "jsonrpc",
          "method"
        ],
        "properties": {
          "jsonrpc": {
            "const": "2.0"
          },
          "id": {
            "type": [
              "string",
              "integer"
            ],
            "description": "Leave out for a notification."
          },
          "method": {
            "type": "string",
            "enum": [
              "initialize",
              "ping",
              "tools/list",
              "tools/call",
              "notifications/initialized"
            ]
          },
          "params": {
            "type": "object"
          }
        }
      },
      "JsonRpcResponse": {
        "type": "object",
        "required": [
          "jsonrpc",
          "id"
        ],
        "properties": {
          "jsonrpc": {
            "const": "2.0"
          },
          "id": {
            "type": [
              "string",
              "integer",
              "null"
            ]
          },
          "result": {
            "type": "object",
            "description": "For tools/call: { content: [{ type: \"text\", text: <the tool's JSON, as a string> }], isError }."
          },
          "error": {
            "type": "object",
            "required": [
              "code",
              "message"
            ],
            "properties": {
              "code": {
                "type": "integer"
              },
              "message": {
                "type": "string"
              }
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "Pilot": {
        "type": "object",
        "description": "One club member or instructor.",
        "required": [
          "name",
          "certificate",
          "declaredTotalTimeHours",
          "landingsLast90Days"
        ],
        "properties": {
          "name": {
            "type": "string"
          },
          "certificate": {
            "type": [
              "string",
              "null"
            ],
            "description": "Certificate and ratings as the pilot entered them on their profile, e.g. \"Private Pilot ASEL\" or \"Student\". Null when blank."
          },
          "declaredTotalTimeHours": {
            "type": [
              "number",
              "null"
            ],
            "description": "Total flight time the pilot entered on their profile. Null when blank."
          },
          "landingsLast90Days": {
            "type": "integer",
            "description": "Landings in this club's log over the last 90 days, night ones included. A flight with no landing count counts as 1; flying elsewhere isn't counted.",
            "example": 7
          }
        }
      },
      "Pilots": {
        "type": "object",
        "required": [
          "note",
          "pilots"
        ],
        "properties": {
          "note": {
            "type": "string"
          },
          "pilots": {
            "type": "array",
            "items": {
              "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Pilot"
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "ClubSnapshot": {
        "type": "object",
        "required": [
          "generatedAt",
          "clubTimeZone",
          "pilots",
          "lastFlown",
          "bookings"
        ],
        "properties": {
          "generatedAt": {
            "type": "string",
            "format": "date-time"
          },
          "clubTimeZone": {
            "type": "string",
            "example": "America/Los_Angeles"
          },
          "pilots": {
            "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Pilots"
          },
          "lastFlown": {
            "type": "array",
            "description": "Each active airplane's most recent flight. An airplane never flown is left out.",
            "items": {
              "$ref": "#/components/schemas/LastFlight"
            }
          },
          "bookings": {
            "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Bookings"
          }
        }
      },
      "LastFlight": {
        "type": "object",
        "description": "An airplane's most recent flight: who flew it, and when.",
        "required": [
          "tailNumber",
          "pilot",
          "flownOn"
        ],
        "properties": {
          "tailNumber": {
            "type": "string",
            "example": "N8318B"
          },
          "pilot": {
            "type": "string"
          },
          "flownOn": {
            "type": "string",
            "format": "date-time"
          }
        }
      }
    }
  }
}
